Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:33.74,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:38.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Comment: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:48.76,OPJP,,0,0,0,,The distance between us bends all dimensions
Comment: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:53.09,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Calling me, calling me, no transmissions
Comment: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.18,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Say again!
Comment: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,奪ったり奪われたり　誰の為のREAL?
Comment: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,上がり下がりまくり　また嫌な夢
Comment: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.06,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54}歪む。眩む目を開いて\N{\fs46}(what should I do...)
Comment: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:04.23,OPJP,,0,0,0,,境目surviving　己を裁いてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.99,OPJP,,0,0,0,,失うものなど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:15.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:21.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,あれは誰の夢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:26.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,この世の全て　その手で総べて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now? What did you get to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:36.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,There was hope in your hands, When you played in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,もう何もないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:44.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,愛も未来も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:49.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:55.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:33.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是否在夢中化作了蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:38.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,,亦或是本就身處蝴蝶的夢境?
Comment: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:48.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,你我相隔的距離  將所有維度盡數扭曲
Comment: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:53.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,,聲聲呼喚著我  卻總是杳無音信
Comment: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,再說一遍!
Comment: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,,奪取與被奪  周而復始  這殘酷的現實究竟為誰而存?
Comment: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,,跌宕起伏不斷  又是一場令人厭惡的夢
Comment: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.06,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fs46}(我該如何是好…){\fs54}\N視線扭曲。睜開暈眩的雙眼
Comment: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:04.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,苟存於虛實交界之淵  不斷審判著自我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}傾注一切  孤注一擲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.99,OPCN,,0,0,0,,又有什麼可失去的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:15.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,傾注一切  孤注一擲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:21.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,那究竟是誰的夢境?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:26.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,將世間萬物  皆由你之手執掌統治
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,如今的你幸福嗎?  你又為此付出了怎樣的代價?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:36.51,OPCN,,0,0,0,,憶往昔於沙中嬉戲之時  你的掌心曾滿載著希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,而如今早已一無所有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:44.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,不論是愛  還是未來  皆不復有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:49.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是否在夢中化作了蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:55.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}亦或是本就身處蝴蝶的夢境?
